Package: lh-firmware-sign-cli
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sameer Tawade <ops@logihertz.com>
Homepage: https://www.logihertz.com
Description: lh-fw-sign - Hybrid Dual-Algorithm Signature Verification Invariant
 Zero-dependency Go PKCS#11 v3.0 HSM-compatible binary firmware signer implementing hybrid Ed25519 + RSA-PSS-SHA384 signatures, LHFWSIG1 anti-rollback trailers, X.509 code-signing chains, and RFC 3161 TSA tokens.
